3. Added proper header values including `x-nonce`
4. Wrapped the component in a Suspense boundary to handle any async loading
5. Added proper props to the ImportedComponent (t and headers)
6. Added a background color class to ensure proper styling

The component should now render properly with mocked dependencies. The error was occurring because the component was trying to access headers and translations that weren't available in the preview environment. By providing these mock values, we should resolve the error.

